.el .ds Aq '
.TH dfdu-peers 1  "dfdu-peers " 
.SH NAME
dfdu\-peers \- List live peer\-mode instances on this host, removing stale entries
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdfdu peers\fR [\fB\-\-discover\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List live peer\-mode instances on this host, removing stale entries
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-discover\fR
Discover hosts over LAN and tailnet UDP
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print instance metadata as JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
